THESIS: A calm control room makes autonomous exploration inspectable at every step.
OWN-WORLD: Jet-black surfaces, graphite structure, pearlescent controls, and explicit operational states.
STORY: Grant consent, choose an app, watch the scan, then inspect or export its Knowledge Pack.
FIRST VIEWPORT: Trust explanation and live permission state appear before the first irreversible choice.
FORM: Native Material task flow with one primary action and an always-visible recovery path.
-->
